# Payload-free states, and the only coverage for EMIT and UNREACHABLE.
#
# `On x Reset` is UNREACHABLE because a supervisor guarantees Reset only
# arrives while Off. That is exactly the kind of claim UNREACHABLE exists to
# record: if it fires, the surrounding system has a bug, not this machine.

machine Toggle
initial Off
states  Off On
actions Flip Poke Reset

Off | GO(On, Light) | EMIT(Buzz) | IGNORE
On  | GO(Off)       | HANDLE     | UNREACHABLE
